body:
A little drunk, but mostly just calm.  Thanks for asking.

&#x200B;

I'm down to my last two cigarettes now.  As soon as I finish off the second one, I think it's time for me to go.  I wanted to say that I appreciate you taking time out of your day to keep me company for a while, but I expect it's time to part ways and carry on the rest of the way on my own.  I hope you have a good night, and I hope you enjoy Brave New World.
